le. A home with over a century of history and a location this good rarely comes along. Bring your vision and make it your own. Some photos virtually staged. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$389,777"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","779 sq ft"],["Lot size","2,430 sq ft"],["Year built","1912"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Riverdale"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5H3R6"],["MLS® number","E4514319"],["Listed","October 26, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Stove, Dryer, Freezer"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Partially finished, Full"],["Parking","See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.23 m × 5.23 m (10'7\" × 17'2\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","6.30 m × 2.69 m (20'8\" × 8'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.44 m × 3.19 m (11'3\" × 10'6\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","4.17 m × 2.31 m (13'8\" × 7'7\")"]],"courtesy":"Erick Yip, RE/MAX Elite and Sue Gaudin, RE/MAX Elite","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"riverdale","area":"central-edmonton"}